# Scene
trueqbit with Claude (Opus 5.5), 2026-11-08: the Purpose check pass over
the 23 Purposes #1605 adds, on its own branch (#1605 is approved; a new
review is the accepted price of a complete pull request). A first
report-only reviewer pass, briefed with the rule alone, found 11; two
re-checks followed, the second and third reading the Action against the
